[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へぇ。私はここで目を覚まして、ハイディと\n出会ったのね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this is where I woke up and met Heidi..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロマンさん。わざわざ付き合っていただいて\nありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you for coming all this way with us, Roman."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いやなに、私もちょうどここを再調査しようと\n考えていたところだったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, it's nothing. I was planning to reinvestigate this place anyway."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この遺跡はランターナ以前、「ネブラ文明」時代の\n遺跡だと言われていた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These ruins are said to predate Lantarna, from the time of the Nebra Civilization."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ネブラは謎に包まれた古代文明で、\n詳細は一切不明だったが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Nebra were a mysterious ancient civilization, and we knew nothing about it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その答えが、転がり込んできた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Until the answers fell right into our laps."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ネブラは、パルメ族が後世に残した偽の名前……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Nebra was just a guise used by the Palme..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれから様々な文献を当たってみましたが、\n「パルメ族」という名は一切見当たりませんでしたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've searched through various texts since then, but there's not a single mention of the Palme anywhere."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんでわざわざ偽名なんか使ったのかしらね。\n逆に面倒じゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why bother with a fake name anyway? Seems like more trouble than it's worth."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "理由があるとすれば、わたくしたち現代の者とは\n異なる種族の存在を隠蔽するため、でしょうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perhaps it was to conceal the existence of a race different from us modern folk."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確かに。私はパルメ族の存在を知るまで、\nネブラとは我々の先祖が築いた文明だと思っていた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. Until I learned about the Palme, I thought Nebra was a civilization built by our ancestors."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう考えるのが普通ですわ。だからこそ、\n彼らは自分たちの存在を隠すため、名を変えた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That would be the natural assumption. Which is precisely why they needed the ruse."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ともあれ、彼らを白日の下に引きずり出したからには、\n「パルメ族」と正しく呼んで差し上げるべきでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now that we've dragged them into the light, we should at least do them the courtesy of using their proper name—the Palme."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ザスキア、そしてアウグストのことも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The same goes for Saskia and August."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、そうだね。ただ、世間には公表していないから\n仲間内だけに留めておいたほうがいいだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right you are. Though since this isn't public knowledge, we should keep it between ourselves."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術が栄えたけど滅んだ、前時代の遺跡ね。\nそういうの、元の世界にもあったわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ancient ruins from an age where alchemy flourished before vanishing... We had those in my world too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、あっちはナントカ族みたいなのじゃなくて、\nあたしたちのご先祖が残したものだと思うけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though I'm pretty sure those were left by our ancestors, not some mysterious ancient race."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア、何か気付いたことはある？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria, does anything feel familiar?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん。そうねぇ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. Well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアを生んだのがパルメ族なのだとしたら、\nこの遺跡と関係があっても不思議ではないね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If the Palme created Valeria, it wouldn't be strange for her to have some connection to these ruins."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハイディがこの場所で、ほとんど記憶がない状態の\nヴァレリアと会った、という情報から考えると……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Given that Heidi found her here with almost no memories..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もしかして、ヴァレリアはここで眠っていた……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could Valeria have been sleeping here...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーーーーん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmmmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――ナナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Nana"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア？\u3000どうしたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria? What's wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――ナナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Nana"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何、これ……！\u3000ううっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What is this...! Nngh...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア！\u3000ヴァレリア、大丈夫！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria! Valeria, are you okay?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うっ……頭の中に、変な景色が浮かんで……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My head... I'm seeing strange images flood in..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私のこと、「ナナ」って……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They called me... Nana..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確か、パルメ族の二人もそう呼んでいた……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right—both members of the Palme called you that...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "彼女の昔の記憶……でしょうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These must be memories from her past..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア。無理しないで、少し休もう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's no need to push yourself. Do you need a break?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だい……じょうぶ。何か思い出したら、\nみんなの力に……なれるかも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm... fine. Remembering something... might be helpful somehow..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何か……うっ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Something... ugh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]